WHEREAS, DILG Memorandum Circular No. 2025-104 directs all barangays to utilize the LGUSS-BIMS as the repository of vital barangay data;

WHEREAS, the Sangguniang Barangay recognizes the need to complement the said system with digital services for residents;

NOW THEREFORE, BE IT ORDAINED...

